    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 145,
        "text": "Thanks for coming, everyone. Today we need to decide about the new automation system for customer support. Tom, you wanted to say something?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "283ba7fe801502c850784cdb0264fc481d4ad13c3d4f0b1343171609bb993eb1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 151,
        "sourceEnd": 303,
        "text": "Yes. I think we should use automation to answer simple questions. It can save time and reduce costs. But we must keep human agents for complex problems.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f9921cb4a078e8c5344b0c1bf5b42ed2ac04cac90fd929a99383c563748948fb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 309,
        "sourceEnd": 415,
        "text": "That's a good point. But some customers prefer to talk to a person. They don't like waiting for a machine.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "b3eef287223fee5d90ea4279da61d9a8c2d746c2013e27dfe305e10dcc3a0d67",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 421,
        "sourceEnd": 566,
        "text": "I agree. That's why I suggest using automation only for basic questions, like checking order status. For anything difficult, a human should help.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b350d32015a6f3d719101125eb00cb87dbae5eeeeb272a736334bd6e3f4681fa",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 572,
        "sourceEnd": 669,
        "text": "OK. So we need to train staff to use the new system. And we should monitor customer satisfaction.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "31abd4a4c3282eacad703073d5bd45183c89c9b6fcfee077b85b658b55faf9ff",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 675,
        "sourceEnd": 797,
        "text": "Exactly. Also, we should avoid making customers angry. If the system fails, they should be able to reach a person quickly.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "2fe3917fd0667fa1521809b013e76f6f8d0b8c7dd72bf847152f5d879fc079f2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 803,
        "sourceEnd": 888,
        "text": "Right. Let's plan a small test first. We can start with one team and see how it goes.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9de4f1a3f88c9462af840ce317c91447cf1a8a39bdec2cc65c68a3126b25911e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 894,
        "sourceEnd": 958,
        "text": "Good idea. I'll prepare a report to show the benefits and risks.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "231b7cfdfcc2ec9ca87bebe6e85d18bf47df90fdeb5de4548a0e6943a5263680",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 964,
        "sourceEnd": 1025,
        "text": "Great. Let's meet again next week to review the test results.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "df52e30f4747cacd8dd4527e6e2c0a2dbe32c52d1496ef32b1c4073fe6cc20e5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
